blocks.en:
Our pre-trained model backbones were produced with Andrej Karpathy’s nanochat, 21 21 21 https://github.com/karpathy/nanochat a compact, full-stack codebase for training decoder-only (GPT-style) language models, using the original implementation in its depth-34 configuration.
We kept nanochat’s model definition, optimizer, data pipeline, and evaluation code unchanged;
modifications for pre-training our own backbones in this work involved altering the batch-size schedule.

